 image switches from the item/flat photo to the model photo.\n# Given the card renders on wishlist, when on desktop and the user hovers, then the arrows appear for the shopper to click through the product images.\n\n*Recently Viewed Full History variation (same behavior as PLP card)*\n\n# Given the card renders on the View Full History Page, when it is in the default state, then the image, name, badge, price (incl. was/now), and cart icon are visible.\n# Given the card renders on View Full History Page, when on desktop and the user hovers, then the size selector becomes visible and the price disappears and the tile image switches from the item/flat photo to the model photo.\n# Given the card renders on View Full History Page, when on desktop and the user hovers, then the arrows appear for the shopper to click through the product images.\n# Given the card renders on View Full History Page, when on mobile, then the size selector is not displayed.\n# Given a product is out of stock, when the card renders, then the cart is greyed out and a notify me link appears on hover instead of price.\n\n*Variation extensibility*\n\n# Given a new style is introduced in future (e.g. Search), when added to the component, then it can be configured without restructuring the base component."
  }
}"}

